# Fixture capture: raw/ contains unscrubbed PII from live runs. Never commit.
fixtures/*/raw/

# Scrubbed fixture output is timestamped-run-directory by default
# (fixtures/<connector>/scrubbed/<runId>/, e.g. 2026-04-23T00-13-01-167Z/).
# Those are local scrubber output, not reviewed-and-curated fixtures, and
# must not be stageable by accident (see incident notes in
# docs/connector-authoring-guide.md — deterministic scrubbing alone can miss
# PII, and human review of a run directory happens locally, not via commit).
# Only the hand-curated, reviewed `pilot-real-shape/` fixture per connector
# is committable; re-allow it and its contents explicitly.
fixtures/*/scrubbed/*/
!fixtures/*/scrubbed/pilot-real-shape/
!fixtures/*/scrubbed/pilot-real-shape/**

# Local data + cache
.pdpp-data/
.pdpp-tools/
